{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all started with a murder...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/3fa7e4ed8ef6a72921080f7f859c1450.poster.avif?t=1769526951\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/3fa7e4ed8ef6a72921080f7f859c1450.webm?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/3fa7e4ed8ef6a72921080f7f859c1450.mp4?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2279, and Enoch stands as humanity's last bastion, where the vast majority of inhabitants live in abject poverty, under the rule of gangs. In this harsh environment, six people are about to meet their fate:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arten Long and John Nakanaga</strong> are called to a crime scene, unaware that this murder will ignite a series of events that could change the station\u2019s future forever. How far are they willing to go to solve the case?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marcus and Trent Lavergne</strong>, wealthy brothers, stand at a moral crossroads. Will they do what\u2019s right, regardless of the cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice Nandi</strong>, a missing young girl, and <strong>Swan</strong>, a killer, find themselves caught in the web of these unfolding events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enoch: Children of Fate is a sci-fi noir point-and-click adventure\u00a0 with a complex web of intersecting stories. Explore a collapsing society through the eyes of each protagonist, some seeking justice, some redemption, and some determined to leave the truth buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.poster.avif?t=1769526951\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.webm?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.mp4?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth isn't lost. It's scattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find it, through their memories, their lies, and your own choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>complex </strong>web of <strong>overlapping storylines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>point-and-click</strong> gameplay with a modern interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong>, each with their own struggles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning <strong>pixel art</strong> graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced</strong> by professional voice actors.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2086690?t=1769526951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2086690?t=1769526951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/212131b4305d31d5a5bb556893924f92995c9df5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769526951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/212131b4305d31d5a5bb556893924f92995c9df5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17695269