 girl, and <strong>Swan</strong>, a killer, find themselves caught in the web of these unfolding events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enoch: Children of Fate is a sci-fi noir point-and-click adventure\u00a0 with a complex web of intersecting stories. Explore a collapsing society through the eyes of each protagonist, some seeking justice, some redemption, and some determined to leave the truth buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.poster.avif?t=1769526951\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.webm?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2086690/extras/6f917dd48cab4832a7888d2211d0554c.mp4?t=1769526951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth isn't lost. It's scattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find it, through their memories, their lies, and your own choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>complex </strong>web of <strong>overlapping storylines</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic <strong>point-and-click</strong> gameplay with a modern interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable characters</strong>, each with their own struggles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning <strong>pixel art</strong> graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced</strong> by professional voice actors.</p>","developers":["Evil Pug Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst